{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39981","headline":"上卢三拾遗以言见黜 · 徐夤","name":"上卢三拾遗以言见黜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骨鲠如君道尚存，近来人事不须论。\n疾危必厌神明药，心惑多嫌正直言。\n冷眼静看真好笑，倾怀与说却爲冤。\n因思周庙当时诫，金口三缄示後昆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}